   'Republic Act No. 7586, also known as the National Integrated Protected Areas System (NIPAS) Act of 1992, was significant because it established a comprehensive system for managing protected areas in the Philippines. This act provided the legal framework for the conservation of biodiversity and the management of protected areas.',
